# Tables that belong to no space and no user. Every other table is ISpaceOwned or IUserOwned.
#
# One table per line:  table_name  [EntityType]  # why it is global
#   - EntityType is the simple name of the entity class. Analyzer DRV0006 reads it, so a DbSet of that entity is
#     allowed without an ownership interface. A table with no entity class leaves it out.
#   - tests/Drover.Data.Tests checks that this list matches the database and the EF Core model.
#
# Adding a line means a table sits outside the isolation suite's generated tests. Give the reason, and name the
# test that covers its policy, in the pull request.

__EFMigrationsHistory                # EF Core bookkeeping. The app role has no privilege on it.
spaces  Space                        # The tenant itself. Policy: id = current space. Named tests: SpecialPolicyTests.
users   User                         # A person. Policy: own authentication row only. Named tests: SpecialPolicyTests.
user_profiles UserProfile # Safe shared display fields; self-only insert/update, no delete, same-space member reads. Named tests: UserProfileTests.
